rooms_desc ({"This is Cougar's living room. The first thing that catches youreye is the HUGE black leather couch. Then, comes the LARGE screen television. Sitting next to the couch is Cougar'smost treasured item - his guitar. And on the wall hangsa picture. Have fun while you're here and feel free tolook around.... BUT, don't make a mess! Enjoy!","This is Cougar's bedroom. He's spend many lonely hours in here.Right in the middle of the room is a king size bed, too big forhim but he hopes that some day someone would be crowding himin there. Next to the windows is his study table, with stacksof paper strewn everywhere. You would be lucky to be able tosee the surface of the table. Standing obviously out of place are two photos.Next to the table is Cougar's bookshelf, full of books, and on topof it are a dozen or so trophies. Would you keep poor Cougar company for a while here?","This is Cougar's table tennis room. This is where theChampion practices. In the middle of the room is a Stiga Elite Roller table tennis table, and one side,there is a ball machine. Lying on the table is Cougar'sbat, and some balls.",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
rooms_short ({"Cougar's living room","Cougar's bedroom","Cougar's Table Tennis room",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
