items ({({"guitar","an Ibenez classical guitar. you imagine Cougar playing his favourite piece - Recuerdo de la Alhambra..... and you feel relaxed and refreshed....",}),({"photo","The first one is of all Cougar's good friends : saffrin,nemchinov,soozie,boadicea,tuppence,vector,hootie,izekiel etc. The second frame is surprisingly empty.","bed","a HUGE, king-size bed.","table","Cougar's study table, covered with loose leaf papers.","paper","They look like Cougar's lecture notes.","books","Physics, computers, engineering..... aaaarrrrggggghhhh!!!!.","trophies","The trophies Cougar received for his excellence in the academical field (primary school) and sports (atheletics and table tennis).",}),({"machine","it spits out balls in random direction and random spins for Cougar to practice","bat","A Butterfly-SunKoh-1 bat. On one side it has a Yasaka-MarkV-AD-Maximum Rubber, and on the other side it has a Double-Happiness pimpled rubber.","balls","some Nitakku-3-star balls",}),0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
